### MedScribe AI - Query API Testing (Phase 3)
### All query endpoints with example requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query

########################################
# 1. PROCESS STATUS QUERIES
########################################

### Get Processing Status
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/status/RPT-B34BBA34

### Get Complete Processing Details
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/details/RPT-B34BBA34

### Get All Reports for Patient

GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/patient/P12345/reports

########################################
# 2. RESULT QUERIES
########################################

### Get OCR Results

GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-3580339B/ocr

### Get Classification Results
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-05B43572/classification

### Get ICD-10 Results
GET  http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-7A246971/icd10

### Get RX-NORMS Results
GET  http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-7A246971/rxnorm

### Get Risk Assessment
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-7A246971/risk-assessment

### Get Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-7A246971/recommendations

### Get Clinical Insights
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-05B43572/insights

### Get All Results
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-C8CB49FA/all

### Get High-Risk Reports
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/high-risk

### Get Educational Content
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-4F094060/educational-content
########################################
# 3. ERROR QUERIES
########################################

### Get Report Errors
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/errors/RPT-B34BBA34

### Get Recent Errors (Last 24 hours)
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/errors/recent?since=2024-01-15T00:00:00

########################################
# 4. ANALYTICS QUERIES
########################################

### Get Processing Metrics (Last 7 days)
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/analytics/metrics?since=2024-01-01T00:00:00

### Get Stage Statistics
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/analytics/stage-stats?since=2024-01-01T00:00:00

### Get Error Patterns
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/medical-report/query/analytics/error-patterns?since=2024-01-01T00:00:00

########################################
# NOTES
########################################

# 1. Replace RPT-B34BBA34 with actual report IDs from database
# 2. Replace P001 with actual patient IDs
# 3. Adjust date parameters in query strings as needed
# 4. Default date range for analytics: last 7 days
# 5. All timestamps use ISO-8601 format: 2024-01-15T00:00:00
